  "remaining_gorm_gap": {
    "thin_bytes_larger_than_fullp": 924560,
    "thin_text_bytes_larger_than_fullp": 560792,
    "source": "https://github.com/go-gorm/gorm/blob/v1.31.2/schema/schema.go#L366",
    "finding": "Gorm loops over readonly callbackTypes and uses reflect.Value.MethodByName with a nonliteral name. Drop still emits generic reflectSeen. This patch handles Type.Method result uses; plugin can recover finite global/loop name sets. Attribution of the entire gap to this site is an inference, not an ablation result."
  },
